                "{{orderId}}",
                "verify"
              ]
            },
            "description": "IMPORTANT: amount must EXACTLY equal the order total from 'Place order', otherwise it is rejected as tampering. Copy totalAmount from that response. On success the order becomes PAID and e-Points are settled.",
